<title>DENMARK: Topdanmark starts Internet claim service.</title>
<headline>Topdanmark starts Internet claim service.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish insurer Topdanmark A/S said on Monday it had introduced a direct claims service for private and corporate customers on the global Internet system.</p>
<p>&quot;Customers can now locate the necessary claim form on Internet, fill it in and send it directly to us within a matter of seconds,&quot; Topdanmmark said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said it had as yet no plans to introduce direct insurance policy sales on the Internet.</p>
<p>Topdanmark's Internet address is: www.topdanmark.dk.</p>
<p>--Ole Mikkelsen, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
